{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-09-30 08:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE COMPLETES SALE OF GIST, A NON-CORE BUSINESS', 'text': "WORKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / SEPTEMBER 30, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF GIST LIMITED, LINDE'S TEMPERATURE-CONTROLLED LOGISTICS PROVIDER PRIMARILY IN THE UNITED KINGDOM AND IRELAND, TO MARKS & SPENCER GROUP PLC, A LEADING BRITISH RETAILER. THE SALE OF THIS NON-CORE ASSET WAS COMPLETED ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2022."}